  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Improve the upgrade process and documentation for Fedora.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Some of the existing documentation isn't as explicit as it should be (eg identifying explicitly what to change in fedora.fcfg).",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "As far as the process goes, I would suggest the following would be a good target:",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "After an upgrade:",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "content": [
        {
         "content": [
          {
           "text": "the new Fedora installation is at the location previously occupied by the previous Fedora installation, including paths to datastores (object, datastream), paths/locations/URLs/names of databases, etc.",
           "type": "text"
          }
         ],
         "type": "paragraph"
        }
       ],
       "type": "listItem"
      },
      {
       "content": [
        {
         "content": [
          {
           "text": "the previous Fedora installation can be completely removed (ie everything under $FEDORA_HOME, including any sub-folders containing previous datastream/object store, database, etc)",
           "type": "text"
          }
         ],
         "type": "paragraph"
        }
       ],
       "type": "listItem"
      }
     ],
     "type": "bulletList"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "ie, after upgrading a version of software I would expect everything to look as it did prior to the upgrade.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "This may not be possible in all cases depending how far back someone is upgrading from, and the changes in a new release.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "A recent thread on upgrading:",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "http://sourceforge.net/mailarchive/forum.php?thread_name=001701cbc2ab%242ce4cf20%240301010a%40asusp4t533&forum_name=fedora-commons-users"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "http://sourceforge.net/mailarchive/forum.php?thread_name=001701cbc2ab%242ce4cf20%240301010a%40asusp4t533&forum_name=fedora-commons-users",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
